        "@value": "Meow! Calling all cat lovers—join us for a purr-fect variety show!   Celebrate Meowloween with Catbaret—a cat-themed cabaret hosted by Gemma Smith, packed with comedy, music, and burlesque (aka purr-lesque). Come in your most cat-tastic costume for a chance to win our audience costume contest. Plus,"
